===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kaɪl/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|aɪl|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|chyle|kile|kyle|lang=en}}

A insane eleven year-old that drives me crazy that I somehow wound up being friends with.

